{
  "name": "WF-Error-Handler",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# ⚠️ Gestion des Erreurs (E01-E04)\n\n**Workflow séparé déclenché par toute erreur du workflow principal**\n\n- E01 · Error Trigger (capture automatique)\n- E02 · Structuration du message d'erreur\n- E03 · INSERT dans `journal_execution` (lié à la campagne via execution_id)\n- E04 · UPDATE `campagnes` → statut = ERREUR + date_fin\n\n🔗 Lien avec workflow principal : via `execution_id`\n📋 Toute erreur laisse une trace dans `journal_execution`",
        "height": 432,
        "width": 438,
        "color": "#FF0000"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1424,
        -160
      ],
      "id": "4dd22fac-77e2-4c0c-a91d-e0d50b761670",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.errorTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -960,
        -16
      ],
      "id": "cc6c927c-1d35-4cb5-a1a3-ead3b5e38809",
      "name": "E01 · Capture Erreur"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const exec = $json.execution || {};\nconst error = exec.error || {};\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      execution_id: exec.id || null,\n      niveau: \"ERREUR\",\n      etape: error.node?.name || exec.lastNodeExecuted || \"INCONNU\",\n      message: error.description \n        || error.message \n        || (error.messages ? error.messages.join(\" | \") : null)\n        || \"Erreur inconnue\"\n    }\n  }\n];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -768,
        -16
      ],
      "id": "1493d770-c5d7-4eea-a207-1062772a57a2",
      "name": "E02 · Structurer Erreur"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "INSERT INTO journal_execution (campagne_id, niveau, etape, message)\nSELECT id, '{{ $json.niveau }}', '{{ $json.etape }}', '{{ $json.message }}'\nFROM campagnes\nWHERE execution_id = '{{ $json.execution_id }}';",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.6,
      "position": [
        -608,
        -16
      ],
      "id": "ab806372-584b-4d54-89b6-734d4ff4e9d5",
      "name": "E03 · Log Erreur",
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "9CJdZfap0gHnWIUB",
          "name": "ia-contenu-prod"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "UPDATE campagnes\nSET statut = 'ERREUR',\n    date_fin = NOW()\nWHERE execution_id = '{{ $('Structurer Erreur').item.json.execution_id }}';",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
